UnsupportedSyntax

  x A unary or await expression on the left-hand side of `**` must be parenthesized in strip-only mode
   ,-[2:1]
 1 | async function asAssertion() {
 2 |     return await input as number ** 2;
   :            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 3 | }
   `----
